<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-023 — calcospherites grow by radial deposition about a centre (Harting 1872 artificial CaCO3 concretions in egg albumen) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module docstring (L1-70) maps E1-E6 to Thompson page numbers, to the Lean theorems by name, and lists each specimen measurement with the figure it tests; function docstrings cite Zener / Mullins-Sekerka, Keller-Rubinow / Ostwald, Niemeyer et al., Jablczynski / Matalon-Packter; test names in `evaluate_claim` quote the Thompson sentence each one checks; `math_kg_loops/thompson1917-t1917-023.yaml` pins code loci per law." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-023 — calcospherites grow by radial deposition about a centre (Harting 1872 artificial CaCO3 concretions in egg albumen) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "E1-E5 implemented as in the reference JSON and the Lean module (`radial_growth_laws` L158-170, `simulate_front_rounding` L174-207 with isotropic and chessboard metrics, `simulate_voronoi_impingement` L211-253 with Poisson and hard-core centres, `simulate_liesegang_radial` L257-305 d-dimensional Ostwald supersaturation with nucleation/growth thresholds and a threshold-free control, `simulate_dbm_cluster` L332-384). Remaining gap: the Mullins-Sekerka boundary is represented by the DBM surrogate rather than a sharp-interface diffusion solver, and the E5 model is not calibrated to CaCO3/albumen kinetics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-model-fidelity-5> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-023-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-023 — calcospherites grow by radial deposition about a centre (Harting 1872 artificial CaCO3 concretions in egg albumen) — Morphometric validation: 87/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval` (L710-769) returns 21 metrics, 19 with reference values, including specimen-derived numbers (Fig. 196 radius CV, radial-line indices, Fig. 197 neighbours vs same-pipeline Voronoi with KS p, Fig. 208 gap CV, Liesegang P with geometric/arithmetic r and RMSE and gap Spearman, ooid asphericity vs E3 prediction) and explicit controls (chessboard exponent, no-gap band count, random-centre null). `evaluate_claim` (L690-707) turns seven of them into pass/fail tests with stated thresholds; `write_result` (L772-820) records the verdict and caveats. The KS between E5 and the specimen ratio distributions fails (p < 0.01) and is reported rather than hidden." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
